 crates/ui/src/boundary_viz.rs                 |  26 ++++-
 .../ui/src/egui_app/tests/frame_cost_probe.rs | 101 +++++++++++++-----
 crates/ui/src/egui_app/world.rs               |   6 +-
 docs/decisions/2246-area-preview-fill.md      |  28 +++++
